Arara Code: generic fixed leading action in a native composite bar.

Why a patch: stable and proposed extension APIs can contribute view containers,
but cannot insert an immovable leading action into the native actions-container.
The extension supplies visibility, label, icon, theme color, selected state and
command through _workbench.setViewContainerLeadingAction.<location>. The core
renders a native keyboard-accessible action outside the draggable container
model, reserves its width and excludes the matching container from duplicates
and overflow. All product state and behavior remain in the extension.
Touches: src/vs/workbench/browser/parts/compositeBar.ts, paneCompositeBar.ts

